    "Preserve early exact-owned BadWindow query errors with captured pixels; foreign, unexpected or settled errors cannot pass and no retry replaces a failed frame.",
    "Correct the outer exception path to fail after earlier passed substeps; calibrate it with a real retained helper exit code 7.",
    "Retain the GDK startup/false-outcome defect, unhandled closing-window race and complete preliminary prototype with exact source archives.",
    "Keep default behavior and general-enable limits; correct the developer guide to the already-admitted 3 GiB allocation."
